  "ingredients": [
    "36 OREO Cookies, finely crushed",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "waxed paper",
    "16 ounces semi-sweet baking chocolate, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iWqxyrJtIW7KSR-57mUIwyZSzUs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229415-oreo-cookie-balls-ddmfs-Step-01-cd65f2d52fbb416f93e121f2588ee943.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229415/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix crushed Oreo cookies and cream cheese in a large bowl until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_ooihwJGHDgk1RI91b58hXjD-vI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229415-oreo-cookie-balls-ddmfs-Step-02-9b1b1e329f784e09b7534279fcac50ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229415/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use your hands to shape mixture into 48 (1-inch) balls; place on a tray and freeze until thoroughly chilled, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3bd21zuMQzv6luwdDE1udelzWQE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229415-oreo-cookie-balls-ddmfs-Step-03-b4d45a987230416a868237a21e574dcf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229415/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a shallow pan with waxed paper. Dip Oreo balls in melted chocolate using a fork or toothpick, letting excess chocolate drip off before placing them in a single layer on the prepared pan. When you remove the fork or toothpick, you may see tiny holes in the coating. Use a spoon to dab a little melted chocolate over the holes to smooth and seal them.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ONDF1u9zGVTREjfhEAaXUlawX98=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229415-oreo-cookie-balls-ddmfs-Step-04-d490657ffb3449c891da758225fbd9de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229415/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate until firm, about 1 hour. Store in a covered container in the refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DB9zeiqvDqa-YdUu6V_7qUJdb38=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229415-oreo-cookie-balls-ddmfs-Step-05-25889f628ca740a199d2eef4e4f9ac51.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229415/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
